<title>UK: CS First Boston sets warrants on D.Telekom.</title>
<headline>CS First Boston sets warrants on D.Telekom.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston Effecten GmbH has issued two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Deutsche Telekom AG, lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston AG, Frankfurt said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>ONE WARRANT CONTROLS ONE SHARE.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD O6.DEC.96-30.DEC.97   PAYDATE	06.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p>	   STRIKE     ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A  32.0 DEM   3.60 DEM   18.14 PCT    5.51 X</p>
<p> CALL B  36 DEM     1.83 DEM   18.82 PCT    5.31 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
